flowchart TD
  UI[React / TS / Vite workbench] --> API[HTTP and SSE]
  API --> Kernel[Go modular monolith]
  Kernel --> PG[(PostgreSQL 18)]
  Kernel --> Blobs[Company-scoped artifact files]
  Kernel --> Supervisor[Trusted supervisor / dispatcher]
  Supervisor --> Harness[Qualified Agent harness]
  Harness --> Tools[Restricted tool environment]
  Kernel --> Queue[Durable tasks / outbox / employee schedules]
  Queue --> PG
  PG -. notification hints only .-> Kernel
  Tools --> Evidence[Versioned artifacts / receipts / evidence]
  Evidence --> Kernel
